 "intro_zh": "苏库尔文化景观包括建在小山上俯瞰下方村庄的酋长宫殿、平坦的场地和神圣的图腾，以及曾经繁荣的铁器工业的大量遗迹。这一景观完整地体现了社会原貌，反映了它的精神文明和物质文明。",
 "intro_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "intro_en": "The Sukur Cultural Landscape, with the Palace of the Hidi (Chief) on a hill dominating the villages below, the terraced fields and their sacred symbols, and the extensive remains of a former flourishing iron industry, is a remarkably intact physical expression of a society and its spiritual and material culture.",
